      "transcript": "\n\n\"Greg.\"\n\nThe dragon's mouth moved again.\n\nThere.\n\nThe expression.\n\nHe had caught me.\n\nI knew it and resented him for making me know it too.\n\n",
      "pause_after_ms": 1100
    },
    {
